            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.9+ACT.10.10+ACT.10.11+ACT.10.12+ACT.10.13+ACT.10.14+ACT.10.15+ACT.10.16+ACT.10.17+ACT.10.18+ACT.10.19+ACT.10.20+ACT.10.21+ACT.10.22+ACT.10.23+ACT.10.24+ACT.10.25+ACT.10.26+ACT.10.27+ACT.10.28+ACT.10.29+ACT.10.30+ACT.10.31+ACT.10.32+ACT.10.33+ACT.10.34+ACT.10.35+ACT.10.36+ACT.10.37+ACT.10.38+ACT.10.39+ACT.10.40+ACT.10.41+ACT.10.42+ACT.10.43+ACT.10.44+ACT.10.45+ACT.10.46+ACT.10.47+ACT.10.48"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mdo 10:9-48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalikuwa katika mji wa Yafa, nikiomba, roho yangu ikazimia, nikaona maono; chombo kinashuka, kama nguo kubwa inatelemshwa kutoka mbinguni kwa pembe zake nne, kikanifikilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikakitazama sana, nikifikiri, nikaona wanyama wa nchi wenye miguu minne, na wanyama wa mwituni, nao watambaao, na ndege wa angani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikasikia na sauti ikiniambia, Ondoka, Petro, ukachinje ule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikasema, Hasha, Bwana, kwa maana kitu kilicho kichafu au kilicho najisi hakijaingia kabisa kinywani mwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauti ikanijibu mara ya pili kutoka mbinguni, Alivyovitakasa Mungu, usivinene wewe najisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jambo hili likatendeka mara tatu, kisha vitu vyote vikavutwa tena juu mbinguni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na tazama, mara hiyo watu watatu wakasimama mbele ya nyumba tuliyokuwamo, waliotumwa kwangu kutoka Kaisaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Roho akaniambia nifuatane nao, nisione tashwishi. Ndugu hawa sita nao wakaenda pamoja nami, tukaingia katika nyumba ya mtu yule; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akatueleza jinsi alivyomwona malaika aliyesimama nyumbani mwake na kumwambia, Tuma watu kwenda Yafa ukamwite Simoni aitwaye Petro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atakayekuambia maneno ambayo yatakuokoa, wewe na nyumba yako yote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa nilipoanza kunena, Roho Mtakatifu akawashukia kama alivyotushukia sisi mwanzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mdo 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikalikumbuka neno lile la Bwana, jinsi alivyosema, Yohana alibatiza kwa maji kweli, bali ninyi mtabatizwa kwa Roho Mtakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi ikiwa Mwenyezi Mungu amewapa wao karama ile ile aliyotupa sisi tuliomwamini Bwana Yesu Kristo, mimi ni nani niweze kumpinga Mungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.48"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mdo 13:48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliposikia maneno haya wakanyamaza, wakamtukuza Mungu, wakisema, Basi, Mungu amewajalia hata mataifa nao toba liletalo uzima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kanisa la Antiokia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
